t: mark a hook implementation function such that the plugin machinery will try to call it last/as late as possible. DEPRECATED, use @pytest.hookimpl(trylast=True) instead.']",
  "max_warnings": "''",
  "minversion": "''",
  "norecursedirs": "['*.egg', '.*', '_darcs', 'build', 'CVS', 'dist', 'node_modules', 'venv', '{arch}']",
  "python_classes": "['Test']",
  "python_files": "['test_*.py', '*_test.py']",
  "python_functions": "['test']",
  "pythonpath": "[]",
  "required_plugins": "[]",
